        "original_id": "64b2ded1-fd45-5f09-adab-b5aa40ff019c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse, Jessica Stroup, Élodie Yung\n- Products: Iron Fist, The Defenders, Daredevil, 90210, The Following, The Bold and the Beautiful, Spring Awakening, Marvel's Iron Fist\n- Concepts: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and is an American actress.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Georg Zirschnitz in the 2015 Deaf West Broadway revival of \"Spring Awakening.\"\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to \"The Defenders\" crossover miniseries.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in \"Marvel's Iron Fist\" and Saul Feinberg in \"The Bold and the Beautiful.\"\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for playing Erin Silver on \"90210,\" Max Hardy on \"The Following,\" and Joy Meachum in \"Iron Fist.\"\n- Élodie Yung is best known for playing Elektra Natchios in the second season of the Marvel Cinematic Universe Netflix series \"Daredevil\" and in the Netflix miniseries \"The Defenders.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
